    {
      "id": "9a896d92-16ce-4957-9cc7-34e60e8f592f",
      "title": "Observe a cena, escute e leia a frase. Agora o foco muda do canal para a origem do dado.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 3,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "5b5d6e4d-548e-45ff-90bf-351b6bb1c8ae",
          "textContent": "<p>Agora o foco muda do canal para a origem da informacao.</p><p><strong>Según una fuente del hospital, la cifra bajó esta mañana.</strong></p><p>Em portugues: <strong>Segundo uma fonte do hospital, o numero caiu esta manha.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/4ad2c9f6e72d4496baa2969c81689b94_b02-b05-press-source-check.png?Expires=1794099760&Signature=PNomXMTUnxt5giTHOqFc472vyj2hCKM0wvvh9AeXv6goRXV~1B1d8yarNCfij3XI3~2iL0KuCcQZG2zOyEujchWI5dTJwmK7qYe6tjwjszLWPJb788Z2jS2EGnF4wBK080pEGxG3VA~~bedvSZPzyh5ohkuaeb5lpUxfU~kxYUVfEYLVQlegjXsQXlqJVao6N3xHfdN5DCCDJCysvHLlT2dBzX0chfZTLDlQHEPLj1zEQGJw817sU6clxjzSXCwJXw1oGdxA1QVTKCULn5n1BL-rUmsBEJ9tV0vuUyMlUym0PVFrGtWEnixLSwKMYaPfNJZtcV11HWiwiq9JkWqIKA__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/b3c39a0d8be340359cbee82d1aa2df05_b03-segun-una-fuente-del-hospital-la-cifra-bajo-esta-manana.mp3?Expires=1794099760&Signature=OI16puTbWoTSGq~nLPraeLYpI0ZV6N0pOXK8FjMIA~BPIlQHb5gcewC9zosTdJHUrDPRfeyLfcEZmIWKsCSL0sV1khkGRwsoXJ6mV7INUgLplY-RZmaYZ~Ch34758S-CswW~heNkp9CyJcLgj3Fe6MjTzAqS73aytlTMFliqEvYXIsY4nawkqjLBe~1gUy8MJjHKnMQyw1u9h0aaP8ZP2MaBHaNp~j-TEXtXOSKGLbl5-ffr3o7LJe3GpAZRDVe1JY01cwnbQeCaml0AJgkn2OaWRU3vgBlKst-VYvXyaPIXhCVy0VW6qwAcS4eg6OTf5yK8VNiyJFL-PwnjJ71GFA__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
