    {
      "id": "3ebf672e-fcd6-4d00-a9f5-4711736869bf",
      "title": "Leia a comparacao curta e observe como as duas palavras respondem a perguntas diferentes.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 4,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "a52f531a-34ca-4bac-8b44-8c0002eb30cd",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>Medio</strong> responde a <strong>onde você viu, leu ou ouviu</strong> a notícia.</p><p><strong>Fuente</strong> responde a <strong>de onde saiu a informação</strong>: uma pessoa, um documento, um relatorio ou um porta-voz.</p><p>Por isso, a mesma notícia pode aparecer em vários <strong>medios</strong> e ainda assim vir da mesma <strong>fuente</strong>.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "eed1bb88-f7ae-4d77-a556-582ccbee460d",
      "title": "Observe a cena, escute e leia a frase. Repare que agora a fala ja nao nomeia canal nem origem: ela avalia a informacao.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 5,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "060fa1d4-51f0-43dc-8f55-9c998a5b0e4c",
          "textContent": "<p>Agora entra o criterio minimo antes de repetir a noticia.</p><p><strong>Si citan la fuente, me parece confiable.</strong></p><p>Em portugues: <strong>Se citam a fonte, isso me parece confiavel.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/4ad2c9f6e72d4496baa2969c81689b94_b02-b05-press-source-check.png?Expires=1794099760&Signature=PNomXMTUnxt5giTHOqFc472vyj2hCKM0wvvh9AeXv6goRXV~1B1d8yarNCfij3XI3~2iL0KuCcQZG2zOyEujchWI5dTJwmK7qYe6tjwjszLWPJb788Z2jS2EGnF4wBK080pEGxG3VA~~bedvSZPzyh5ohkuaeb5lpUxfU~kxYUVfEYLVQlegjXsQXlqJVao6N3xHfdN5DCCDJCysvHLlT2dBzX0chfZTLDlQHEPLj1zEQGJw817sU6clxjzSXCwJXw1oGdxA1QVTKCULn5n1BL-rUmsBEJ9tV0vuUyMlUym0PVFrGtWEnixLSwKMYaPfNJZtcV11HWiwiq9JkWqIKA__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/7e5da3fd1ebc419382cb04f45530acb4_b05-si-citan-la-fuente-me-parece-confiable.mp3?Expires=1794099760&Signature=i~EneMGcs9WKCHS4I6XZhRE7ku84Ivi3ccFZjtBMFDeAuDYI02Qor7FS1sYFjJgozZC~tfX7dLpeHng8dbmuzXsdNtd-BfDJvjhN2lIqa0ChHTsAKk~5NJDrhDKnmkvwHrkglqd1XkmnLKIAdt1Ia42R0Cn3gpwMriO8cRhAFc2WQnvW9b3a0z0IbuC9XBrbuH9yHhdd~wNbLJmlK-0Tem6lpjmjshAJOaCTfgywevyQWphcKioXnEYe51IqNVfcC~jrX4l0SdzWMJb7UDCZVLt01FZhFdS99KIjcUynPhwG3Mm4MxfRaXnG5Xxkeyu0N-yH7mQz15PweWMThcTlrw__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
