    {
      "id": "b5ead7a2-4284-47c9-9b58-1519739b28f8",
      "title": "Leia a nota e observe como a aula liga confianca a rastro de origem, não a certeza absoluta.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 6,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "f42e2a29-9c6e-4e53-823e-25c6cbc70b36",
          "textContent": "<p>Nesta aula, <strong>confiable</strong> não quer dizer que você prova tudo sozinho.</p><p>Quer dizer que a notícia mostra um rastro mínimo antes de circular: pelo menos aparece <strong>quem</strong> forneceu a informação.</p><p>Quando a fonte some, o comentário em espanhol costuma ficar mais cauteloso.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "0c48e955-a690-4f5d-b170-8042bc9b0a56",
      "title": "Checando de onde vem a notícia",
      "description": "<p>As três peças já apareceram separadas. Aqui elas voltam em uma conversa curta, sem abrir um novo tema jornalistico.</p>",
      "contentType": 7,
      "sequenceItem": 7,
      "items": [],
      "dialogue_bubbles": [
        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">¿Dónde la viste?</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">Onde você viu isso?</div>\n</div>",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/b4661c9cfcc2494d99943ad928c0d1cb_b07-d01-donde-la-viste.mp3?Expires=1794099760&Signature=oQRRjHUnSevi55PdoH5JepJTe41vcorn0spHfBemxh81GlOnbhoaj3He7DyJXjgulpuwVrGaumj0SCwH8eHkBp7ybzSoWguBPQWlltPn~pp7JYoTeizqRYKlcjwByfZ8jrtW6QfgKJt0j01u2WyBzkTncrYaqsaepYHUycDae~WJoOfXtR7fNfnPnhrGs7r5EjAUmez4-brqTsYT58hWMnoI6uymJkzMaq9DPeMVl3WQ49vPzhKklekzcS~VreBEaDthCZ6aNDfoTv3Y2UmaBMGYrwFxHK9oI9wkb0m~bBAU2plgMU-7jatm8yePkPOKrJhET8mB4tIfY1FkW3MOtQ__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "translation": null
        },
        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">La vi en un medio local.</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">Vi a notícia em um veículo local.</div>\n</div>",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/68964211b55741fd921db03a3b5588e7_b02-la-vi-en-un-medio-local.mp3?Expires=1794099760&Signature=XxwxVnbPotmcqnOvomUEEKYx22y452GJSo-pndd~l7c6-nIXU3sDVIhVbt-r9pj7eyskiqAE~yQ8yq1oaPbQK4hZ9ccRrK0TzMbtHuXx3XgDY~C898Gipr9a3g04JRRfub~HV4-uii~tV0BZDv0m9XjNvOQbyiWzGacQbpx7jiJYNa5JiuL9932-HFU~kVBkq7tEp0jRuCJTVVKMO1xKAuV4-rFWuiuSPEMi27HTCECxNH~35SYM0v4yL5NDcyphzaxII7xEfqYA1b9psuNKnqsx-jxFiBrDd2vDRc1jiM1~WCS9LGVpITFcyE6iNUuoiuFJlTyKdk32xOpEkLqOtg__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "translation": null
        },
        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Según una fuente del hospital, la cifra bajó esta mañana.</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">Segundo uma fonte do hospital, o numero caiu esta manhã.</div>\n</div>",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/56bf8e47717e4b39a80439b2e7630fcc_b03-segun-una-fuente-del-hospital-la-cifra-bajo-esta-manana.mp3?Expires=1794099760&Signature=pfTVVjb2z3NXU28J2QrJfviuIKJk-XHmeaEAwLiCGXY7ooq2OWublDFdP7XoRId5oQRc2vD79KtPYOaUvWXlHQ6dbaB1jNivfgcuFhbt8WnuhnHAthnPoMJPO-L25Q1qe2x2cB~jS~C5N2UfDcIlYL6eEOhonTdIDpMA8HYWTln0ZMjzcPhNaJkaaZ2EhMRht5heoDTggje41Szc~WAaJ6QHkx0VbgevK6uiP6uMA4Lc7sGZNmEyt3a81zUhIzAYB39vMetVWfV7cI9vAe2dv2J6cBQIZ5nwlcNExvlnFkaSMc3FPWB39RuOu4EyW1CB~zHcxPu1bwVSLcMmseOhpQ__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "translation": null
        },
        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Si citan la fuente, me parece confiable.</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">Se citam a fonte, isso me parece confiavel.</div>\n</div>",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/3538d022ca1b4d9291fb156a39c3c9c5_b05-si-citan-la-fuente-me-parece-confiable.mp3?Expires=1794099760&Signature=tqWQPyEOPIQNscfWTKzz~C4um1u~QWxwlq2nVY1cKxN2MRZnYqWSmPtlhAynVrypi5DBWb-u7EBSkEVRlux5I3XLm72rnwyHUWUNSnyRXK9SBgmfy2SXjjevDzbWKcK2RUNC~DcVLPV9VmChjcxaaRXQGCp5gVNMBn9ez020vQ5pW6hBhKewnERARwLjgFyn8ghd6TeOU92~jF1ZOAwVtcMw9eO5GNcJiG82SMZaCYNy4B~jymsl0b1pVTC1yk6BesZmUKrG1l~2XwF1K435r~f1TCwyyUhV6fG-X1NKHqTfrMbqHEDpwnGH04T-8y6iW0IsdypVtFP59GUpYQaKzA__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
